WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.067
Graphic designers are fucked

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.203
if making the graphic

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.907
is all they're selling.

00:00:04.907 --> 00:00:06.358
Think about the home-printed

00:00:06.358 --> 00:00:09.361
A4 poster in a café window.

00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:10.384
The owner still had

00:00:10.384 --> 00:00:12.188
a message to get out.

00:00:12.188 --> 00:00:13.273
Now they can make

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:14.599
a better attempt.

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:16.062
A product photo.

00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:17.703
A new background.

00:00:17.703 --> 00:00:19.735
Room for a headline.

00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:21.489
But better tools haven't

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.408
automatically given everyone

00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:24.745
better judgement.

00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:26.360
The customer is buying

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.761
what turns up.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.654
A beautiful lie is still

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:30.865
a shit way to start

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:32.379
that relationship.

00:00:32.379 --> 00:00:34.538
Knowing what to make matters.

00:00:34.538 --> 00:00:35.535
So does knowing

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.973
what to leave out.

00:00:36.973 --> 00:00:38.399
Bring the idea,

00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:40.203
the taste and the care

00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:41.264
that makes the work

00:00:41.264 --> 00:00:42.753
worth paying for.
